# Supabase CLI scratch state. These were tracked by mistake: .temp/project-ref and
# .temp/pooler-url name a live project, so every clone arrived silently linked to it and a
# stray `supabase db push` would have gone straight at production.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
